<title>USA: Osicom Technologies Inc Q4 net profit.</title>
<headline>Osicom Technologies Inc Q4 net profit.</headline>
<dateline>SANTA MONICA, Calif. 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>OSICOM TECHNOLOGIES INC</p>
<p>			    3 Mos ended 1/31    12 Mos ended 1/31</p>
<p>			    1997	 1996	  1997	 1996</p>
<p>Revenues	     $36,824     $8,545    $115,912    $34,473</p>
<p>Cost of sales	 25,909	5,329	84,215     21,729</p>
<p>Gross margin	  10,915	3,216	31,697     12,744</p>
<p>				30%	  38%	   27%	  37%</p>
<p>Net income/(loss)   $1,425    ($1,022)   ($15,609)   ($1,317)</p>
<p>Net income/(loss) applicable to</p>
<p> common shares     $ 1,387    ($1,060)   ($15,759)   ($1,467)</p>
<p>Net EPS</p>
<p>   Primary		0.11	(0.21)	(1.97)     (0.36)</p>
<p>   Fully diluted	0.11	  N/A	   N/A	  N/A</p>
<p>Wgtd avg shrs (restated)</p>
<p> Primary	 12,218,151  4,984,653   8,050,169  4,029,810</p>
<p> Fully diluted 13,625,966	  N/A	   N/A	  N/A</p>
<p>		In Thousands, except for per share data</p>
<p>NOTE: 12 mos ended January 31, 1997, includes $16,474,000 in charges, of which $13,650,000 was purchased research and development expenses.  Also reflects restated results for Q2 second quarter, including acquisition related expenses, pooling costs, purchased research and development expenses, reductions to net realizable value for capitalized software and inventories in connection with acquisitions.</p>
<p>Results for Q4 and year ended January 31, 1996, reflect pooling of interests accounting associated with the acquisitions of Digital Products Inc, Distributed Systems Inc, and Builders Warehouse Association Inc.</p>
<p>In addition, EPS for Q4 and year ended January 31, 1996, adjusted for 2-for-1 stock split effected February 12, 1996.</p>
